迈克尔没听出来。

1286
00:52:13.010 --> 00:52:13.670
He's thrilled.
他很兴奋。

1287
00:52:13.890 --> 00:52:18.610
He says if everybody loses five pounds, that in addition to Jim's 65, we're going to win
他说如果每个人都能减掉5磅，加上吉姆的65磅，我们就能赢下

1288
00:52:18.610 --> 00:52:19.110
this thing.
这场比赛了。

1289
00:52:19.110 --> 00:52:23.690
Well, Angela has presented Andy with her list of criteria for her wedding.
嗯，安吉拉向安迪提出了她对婚礼的要求清单。

1290
00:52:23.930 --> 00:52:24.350
Mm-hmm.
嗯哼。

1291
00:52:24.450 --> 00:52:25.330
It's pretty challenging.
这相当有挑战性。

1292
00:52:25.610 --> 00:52:29.050
Here are the things she has to have in order to marry Andy.
以下是她嫁给安迪必须具备的条件。

1293
00:52:29.350 --> 00:52:29.670
Okay.
好的。

1294
00:52:30.130 --> 00:52:33.810
A thousand-year-old church in the continental United States.
在美国大陆上一座有一千年历史的教堂。

1295
00:52:34.570 --> 00:52:36.030
There has to be a rainbow.
必须得有彩虹。

1296
00:52:36.830 --> 00:52:39.330
24-hour veterinarian on call.
24小时待命的兽医。

1297
00:52:39.790 --> 00:52:43.910
And then she pages Dwight to meet her downstairs, because she just can't really stand being around
然后她传呼德怀特到楼下见她，因为她实在无法忍受和

1298
00:52:43.910 --> 00:52:44.270
Andy.
安迪待在一起。

1299
00:52:44.570 --> 00:52:47.170
But Andy tells Angela, you know what?
但安迪告诉安吉拉，你知道吗？

1300
00:52:47.170 --> 00:52:51.770
I don't care where we get married, because all I care about is spending the rest of my
我不在乎我们在哪里结婚，因为我只在乎与你共度余生

1301
00:52:51.770 --> 00:52:52.530
life with you.
和你在一起的生活。

1302
00:52:52.950 --> 00:52:55.350
This melts Angela's cold, cold heart.
这融化了安吉拉那颗冰冷、冰冷的心。

1303
00:52:55.530 --> 00:52:56.050
It does.
确实如此。

1304
00:52:56.050 --> 00:53:00.050
And she does not show up for her rendezvous with Dwight in the warehouse.
而且她没有去仓库赴德怀特的约。

1305
00:53:00.410 --> 00:53:02.110
She gives Andy a little kiss.
她给了安迪一个小吻。

1306
00:53:02.410 --> 00:53:02.730
Mm-hmm.
嗯哼。

1307
00:53:02.890 --> 00:53:04.570
And of course, he has to make a noise.
当然，他非得弄出点动静来。

1308
00:53:04.870 --> 00:53:05.270
Mm-hmm.
嗯哼。

1309
00:53:05.350 --> 00:53:06.530
He makes like a boo.
他发出了一声“呜”。

1310
00:53:07.390 --> 00:53:07.750
Yep.
没错。

1311
00:53:08.430 --> 00:53:13.910
Well, there's a very sweet deleted scene that shows Angela trying to bond with Andy over
嗯，有一个非常甜蜜的删减片段，展示了安吉拉试图通过婚礼

1312
00:53:13.910 --> 00:53:14.350
the wedding.
与安迪增进感情。

1313
00:53:14.610 --> 00:53:15.890
It's in the break room.
是在休息室里。

1314
00:53:15.890 --> 00:53:19.910
And I titled it, Overly Animated Angela?
我给它起名叫“过于活跃的安吉拉”？

1315
00:53:20.570 --> 00:53:21.110
Mm.
嗯。

1316
00:53:21.770 --> 00:53:25.430
We could get a cake shaped like your cat.
我们可以订一个你猫咪形状的蛋糕。

1317
00:53:25.830 --> 00:53:27.010
They can do that?
他们能做那种吗？

1318
00:53:27.510 --> 00:53:28.150
Yeah.
能。

1319
00:53:28.390 --> 00:53:28.790
Yeah.
能。

1320
00:53:29.110 --> 00:53:35.890
For you, my love, I will find the finest cakesmith in all the land.
为了你，我的爱人，我会找到全城最好的蛋糕师。

1321
00:53:36.790 --> 00:53:41.070
And it deliver me, Sir Bakes-A-Lot, a frosting ham foreSt.
然后让那位“烘焙爵士”给我送来一个糖霜火腿森林。

1322
00:53:42.090 --> 00:53:45.190
What about one shaped like, I don't know, a litter box?
那订一个……我不知道，猫砂盆形状的怎么样？

1323
00:53:45.810 --> 00:53:46.290
Hey-o!
嘿哟！

1324
00:53:46.630 --> 00:53:46.950
Right?
对吧？

1325
00:53:47.070 --> 00:53:48.210
I mean, is it gross or wonderful?
我是说，这到底是恶心还是美妙？

1326
00:53:48.470 --> 00:53:48.790
Ah!
啊！

1327
00:53:48.930 --> 00:53:49.490
I don't know!
我不知道！

1328
00:53:49.690 --> 00:53:50.690
I'll be at my desk.
我去办公桌那边了。

1329
00:53:50.830 --> 00:53:51.690
Page me if you need me.
有事传呼我。

1330
00:53:54.710 --> 00:53:55.810
Who are you?
你是谁？

1331
00:53:55.910 --> 00:53:56.350
I know!
我知道！

1332
00:53:56.690 --> 00:53:57.110
Ah!
啊！

1333
00:53:57.210 --> 00:53:57.790
I don't know!
我不知道！

1334
00:53:58.090 --> 00:53:59.490
Who is this person?
这人是谁？

1335
00:53:59.610 --> 00:54:00.550
I don't know!
我不知道！

1336
00:54:02.050 --> 00:54:04.030
Oh, Overly Animated Angela.
哦，过于活跃的安吉拉。

1337
00:54:04.390 --> 00:54:05.310
She was trying.
她当时在努力尝试。

1338
00:54:05.950 --> 00:54:08.110
Maybe he should just do some Mad Libs.
也许他应该去玩玩填词游戏。

1339
00:54:08.150 --> 00:54:08.870
You love those.
你很喜欢那个。

1340
00:54:09.110 --> 00:54:13.990
I love Mad Libs and keep suggesting cakes that look like cats or cat accessories.
我喜欢填词游戏，而且一直建议订那些看起来像猫或者猫咪用品的蛋糕。

1341
00:54:13.990 --> 00:54:15.430
It's the weight of your heart.
那是你心里的负担。

1342
00:54:15.950 --> 00:54:18.110
Well, Jim has arrived at Pam's dorm room.
好了，吉姆已经到了帕姆的宿舍门口。

1343
00:54:18.330 --> 00:54:20.910
Did you notice that Pam is the resident advisor?
你注意到帕姆是宿舍管理员了吗？

1344
00:54:21.150 --> 00:54:21.590
I did.
我注意到了。

1345
00:54:21.810 --> 00:54:22.690
She's the RA!
她是宿舍管理员！

1346
00:54:23.250 --> 00:54:24.370
It's so perfect.
这太完美了。

1347
00:54:24.950 --> 00:54:25.950
It's perfect.
太完美了。

1348
00:54:25.950 --> 00:54:28.170
But it's also like, Pam.
但这也很有帕姆的风格。

1349
00:54:28.630 --> 00:54:29.790
Take on a job.
找份工作做做。

1350
00:54:30.210 --> 00:54:30.970
Come on!
拜托！

1351
00:54:31.990 --> 00:54:34.530
Well, Jim tells the documentary crew, you know what?
吉姆对纪录片摄制组说，你知道吗？

1352
00:54:34.550 --> 00:54:36.350
Why don't you go check out Pam's art over there?
你们为什么不去看看那边帕姆的艺术作品呢？

1353
00:54:36.470 --> 00:54:39.570
And when they turn to look for it, he quickly shuts the door, right?
当他们转过身去寻找时，他迅速关上了门，对吧？

1354
00:54:39.710 --> 00:54:39.970
Mm-hmm.
嗯哼。

1355
00:54:39.970 --> 00:54:44.350
And at 18 minutes, 31 seconds, you hear the cameraman sigh.
在18分31秒的时候，你能听到摄影师叹了口气。

1356
00:54:44.630 --> 00:54:46.810
You hear Randall Einhorn sigh.
你能听到兰德尔·艾因霍恩叹气的声音。

1357
00:54:46.990 --> 00:54:47.370
Yes!
没错！

1358
00:54:47.510 --> 00:54:48.270
That's Randall!
那是兰德尔！

1359
00:54:48.430 --> 00:54:49.730
And that was improvised.
那是即兴发挥的。

1360
00:54:50.010 --> 00:54:52.950
He just did that, and they loved it, and they kept it in.
他当时就那么做了，他们很喜欢，就保留了下来。

1361
00:54:53.090 --> 00:54:53.610
Oh, yeah.
噢，没错。

1362
00:54:53.750 --> 00:54:54.370
So fun.
太有趣了。

1363
00:54:54.590 --> 00:55:01.050
I would like to say, Pam, thank you for finally wearing a hoodie or any kind of casual clothing
我想说，帕姆，谢谢你终于穿了件连帽衫或者其他休闲装

1364
00:55:01.050 --> 00:55:02.310
here at art school.
来艺术学校了。

1365
00:55:02.490 --> 00:55:05.830
I feel like she just has been overdressed since she got there.
我觉得她自从来到这里就一直穿得太正式了。

1366
00:55:05.830 --> 00:55:07.650
We are on two different pages on this.
在这点上我们的看法完全不同。

1367
00:55:07.790 --> 00:55:10.350
I think that Pam has looked amazing for art school.
我觉得帕姆在艺术学校的打扮看起来棒极了。

1368
00:55:10.610 --> 00:55:12.110
I love her ponytail.
我喜欢她的马尾辫。

1369
00:55:12.570 --> 00:55:17.790
I just think, and this was a choice that, I should say that, this has all been a choice.
我只是觉得，而且这是一个选择，我应该说，这一切都是刻意为之的。

1370
00:55:17.790 --> 00:55:18.770
It's on purpose.
这是故意的。

1371
00:55:19.050 --> 00:55:24.370
It's all to make her stand out a little bit, to be like, she isn't dressing the way the
这一切都是为了让她显得有点与众不同，就像是，她并没有穿得像

1372
00:55:24.370 --> 00:55:26.030
young people dress today.
现在的年轻人那样。

1373
00:55:26.170 --> 00:55:26.430
Right.
对。

1374
00:55:26.630 --> 00:55:26.890
Okay?
好吗？

1375
00:55:26.930 --> 00:55:30.670
So, like, I'm giving her grief about it, but you guys, we planned this.
所以，我是在拿这事调侃她，但伙计们，这是我们计划好的。

1376
00:55:30.830 --> 00:55:31.030
Right.
没错。

1377
00:55:31.130 --> 00:55:34.550
And also her affected speech, how she's like, top of the mountain, Talia.
还有她那种做作的说话方式，就像是，山顶之上，塔莉亚。

1378
00:55:35.010 --> 00:55:36.110
Should we walk over here?
我们要走过去吗？

1379
00:55:36.270 --> 00:55:37.090
Perhaps we'll sit here.
也许我们坐在这儿。

1380
00:55:37.610 --> 00:55:39.670
Let me cross my legs in my stockings.
让我穿着丝袜交叉双腿。

1381
00:55:39.990 --> 00:55:41.090
What are you talking about?
你在说什么呢？

1382
00:55:41.270 --> 00:55:42.130
That's how she talks.
她就是那样说话的。

1383
00:55:42.290 --> 00:55:43.070
No, she does not.
不，她才没有。

1384
00:55:44.010 --> 00:55:44.930
What are you doing?
你在干什么？

1385
00:55:45.150 --> 00:55:46.250
I'm just messing with you.
我只是在逗你玩。

1386
00:55:46.250 --> 00:55:47.150
I really got worried.
我刚才真的担心了。

1387
00:55:47.170 --> 00:55:48.010
I was like, what?
我心想，什么？

1388
00:55:48.690 --> 00:55:50.050
I am messing with you.
我是在逗你玩呢。

1389
00:55:50.470 --> 00:55:54.830
I don't know how long Jim and Pam got to hang out and smooch, but Pam got a knock on
我不知道吉姆和帕姆能待在一起亲热多久，但帕姆的门被敲响了。

1390
00:55:54.830 --> 00:55:55.190
her door.
有个女孩因为别人拿了她的豆奶而对另一个女孩发火。

1391
00:55:55.530 --> 00:55:59.670
There was some girl mad at another girl because someone took someone's soy milk.
现在吉姆在宿舍的公共区域，时间是18分55秒。

1392
00:55:59.670 --> 00:56:05.110
And now Jim is in, like, the dorm room common area at 18 minutes, 55 seconds.
没错。

1393
00:56:05.710 --> 00:56:06.130
Yeah.
他在看一场棒球比赛。

1394
00:56:06.130 --> 00:56:07.870
He's watching a baseball game.
是的。

1395
00:56:08.190 --> 00:56:08.710
Yes.
而且，珍娜，你可以非常微弱地听到一些棒球解说员的声音，就像是播音员，

1396
00:56:08.790 --> 00:56:14.430
And, Jenna, you can very faintly hear some sort of baseball commentators, like announcers,
体育播音员。

1397
00:56:14.630 --> 00:56:15.330
sports announcers.
没错。

1398
00:56:15.510 --> 00:56:15.690
Yeah.
那些声音是由我们自己的制片人詹姆斯·奥凯里和埃里克·科尔根配的。

1399
00:56:15.990 --> 00:56:20.650
Those were played by our very own producer, James O'Kerry and Eric Colgen.
好的。

1400
00:56:20.910 --> 00:56:21.310
All right.
没问题。

1401
00:56:21.450 --> 00:56:24.690
See, I wondered, is that a real baseball game?
你看，我当时就在想，那是真的棒球比赛吗？

1402
00:56:24.850 --> 00:56:28.790
So it's obviously real baseball footage, but then we put our own commentators on it.
所以这显然是真实的棒球比赛录像，但我们配上了自己的解说员。

1403
00:56:28.790 --> 00:56:29.550
That's right.
没错。

1404
00:56:30.030 --> 00:56:31.830
So Jenna and I have been in touch with James.
珍娜和我一直和詹姆斯保持着联系。

1405
00:56:32.070 --> 00:56:32.750
He is fantastic.
他太棒了。

1406
00:56:33.030 --> 00:56:35.230
He was that guy that could, like, get you anything on set.
他就是那种在片场什么都能帮你搞定的人。

1407
00:56:35.350 --> 00:56:36.910
If you needed it, James got it.
只要你需要，詹姆斯就能弄到。

1408
00:56:37.330 --> 00:56:40.910
And we had lots of questions for him, and he answered them for this episode.
我们有很多问题想问他，他都在这一集里为我们解答了。

1409
00:56:41.110 --> 00:56:42.710
He even had the shooting draft.
他甚至还留着拍摄用的剧本草稿。

1410
00:56:42.910 --> 00:56:44.190
James, thank you so much.
詹姆斯，太感谢你了。

1411
00:56:44.350 --> 00:56:46.050
I feel like we might have a Jamesopedia.
我觉得我们可能拥有了一本“詹姆斯百科”。

1412
00:56:46.610 --> 00:56:48.450
Yeah, it couldn't come at a better time.
是啊，这真是再及时不过了。

1413
00:56:48.810 --> 00:56:49.210
Yeah.
没错。

1414
00:56:49.570 --> 00:56:52.550
You know, because we don't have Kentopedia anymore, James.
你知道，因为我们不再有“肯特百科”了，詹姆斯。

1415
00:56:53.490 --> 00:56:57.110
James Carey, will you be our Jamesopedia?
詹姆斯·凯里，你愿意当我们的“詹姆斯百科”吗？

1416
00:56:59.250 --> 00:57:01.770
Should we talk about Stanley's birthday?
我们要聊聊斯坦利的生日吗？

1417
00:57:02.290 --> 00:57:03.930
I mean, it looks a little sad.
我是说，看起来有点冷清。

1418
00:57:04.350 --> 00:57:05.950
Everyone's standing around eating fruit.
大家都在那儿站着吃水果。

1419
00:57:06.090 --> 00:57:07.950
Ronnie wants to know if anyone wants to dance.
罗尼想问有没有人想跳舞。

1420
00:57:08.230 --> 00:57:12.370
By the way, my Dolly Parton fans, did you catch the song playing?
顺便问一下，我的多莉·帕顿粉丝们，你们注意到背景里放的歌了吗？

1421
00:57:12.570 --> 00:57:13.010
Oh, yeah.
哦，听到了。

1422
00:57:13.470 --> 00:57:14.970
Here you come again.
《Here You Come Again》。

1423
00:57:15.310 --> 00:57:16.570
I love that song.
我超爱那首歌。

1424
00:57:16.710 --> 00:57:17.670
I love that song, too.
我也超爱那首歌。

1425
00:57:17.790 --> 00:57:19.950
I went and listened to it after I watched the episode.
看完这一集后，我特意去听了那首歌。

1426
00:57:20.290 --> 00:57:22.910
It's not the song I would play at a birthday party.
那可不是我会在生日派对上放的歌。

1427
00:57:22.910 --> 00:57:26.750
No, no, probably not.
不，不，大概不会。

1428
00:57:27.430 --> 00:57:29.150
But I love that song.
但我确实很喜欢那首歌。

1429
00:57:29.370 --> 00:57:35.470
People are going to sneak off from this party, and they're going to have some cake in the warehouse.
人们会从派对上溜走，去仓库里吃蛋糕。

1430
00:57:35.830 --> 00:57:38.990
The warehouse is the sneak site, clearly.
仓库显然就是那个“偷情地点”。

1431
00:57:39.850 --> 00:57:40.270
Clearly?
显然？

1432
00:57:40.650 --> 00:57:47.330
And I mean, isn't Angela uncomfortable being in that room with all those other people, including her fiancé?
我是说，安吉拉和那么多人待在一个房间里，包括她的未婚夫，难道她不会觉得不自在吗？

1433
00:57:47.930 --> 00:57:49.810
She doesn't have any guilt about it.
她对此一点负罪感都没有。

1434
00:57:49.910 --> 00:57:50.630
I guess not.
我想也是。

1435
00:57:50.630 --> 00:57:52.270
She has no problem sleeping at night.
她晚上睡觉完全没心理负担。

1436
00:57:52.450 --> 00:57:53.210
We've established that.
这一点我们已经确认过了。

1437
00:57:53.210 --> 00:57:53.770
That's true.
确实。

1438
00:57:54.590 --> 00:57:57.850
Stanley is in the room with the cake, but he's not even eating it.
斯坦利在放蛋糕的房间里，但他甚至都没吃。

1439
00:57:57.990 --> 00:57:59.430
He said his tastes have changed.
他说他的口味变了。

1440
00:57:59.850 --> 00:58:06.490
Now all he likes is baklava, which I thought was a really interesting thing to say because baklava is very, very, very sweet.
现在他只喜欢果仁蜜饼，我觉得这说法很有意思，因为果仁蜜饼真的非常、非常、非常甜。

1441
00:58:06.750 --> 00:58:08.350
Like, if you've lost your sweet tooth.
就像是，如果你已经不再爱吃甜食了的话。

1442
00:58:08.490 --> 00:58:09.270
I mean, it's nutty.
我是说，那里面全是坚果。

1443
00:58:10.010 --> 00:58:11.230
I love a baklava.
我超爱果仁蜜饼。

1444
00:58:11.330 --> 00:58:11.750
I do, too.
我也一样。

1445
00:58:11.850 --> 00:58:12.670
It's dense, though.
不过它很扎实。

1446
00:58:12.870 --> 00:58:14.890
It's a dense, sugary treat.
那是一种口感扎实、糖分很高的甜点。

1447
00:58:15.470 --> 00:58:15.930
I know.
我知道。

1448
00:58:16.110 --> 00:58:25.230
And I often eat too much of it, and I get a stomach ache because, you know, they give you a tiny piece, and I'll eat like five of them because they're just so good.
我经常吃太多，结果胃疼，因为你知道，他们只给你一小块，但我会吃掉五块，因为它们实在太好吃了。

1449
00:58:25.570 --> 00:58:26.930
Well, that's what happens with you.
嗯，你就是这样。

1450
00:58:27.130 --> 00:58:28.750
You're always like, Ange, look how cute.
你总是说，安吉，看这多可爱。

1451
00:58:28.750 --> 00:58:29.450
It's so tiny.
太小了。

1452
00:58:29.950 --> 00:58:30.430
I know.
我知道。

1453
00:58:30.550 --> 00:58:31.990
And then you're like, Ange, I have a stomach ache.
然后你就说，安吉，我肚子疼。

1454
00:58:32.190 --> 00:58:32.610
I know.
我知道。

1455
00:58:33.210 --> 00:58:37.350
Dwight, Holly, Michael, and Ronnie spy on the group.
德怀特、霍莉、迈克尔和罗尼在监视那群人。

1456
00:58:37.730 --> 00:58:39.590
Dwight's like, they should not be in there.
德怀特说，他们不该待在那儿。

1457
00:58:39.710 --> 00:58:39.970
Mm-mm.
嗯。

1458
00:58:39.970 --> 00:58:41.550
You know why he's saying that.
你知道他为什么这么说。

1459
00:58:41.970 --> 00:58:44.830
And Michael says, we should have our own party.
然后迈克尔说，我们应该办我们自己的派对。

1460
00:58:44.930 --> 00:58:46.330
Let's all go play mini golf.
我们去打迷你高尔夫吧。

1461
00:58:47.070 --> 00:58:50.110
Ronnie and Michael and Dwight and Holly.
罗尼、迈克尔、德怀特和霍莉。

1462
00:58:50.330 --> 00:58:51.090
That foursome.
那四个人。

1463
00:58:51.430 --> 00:58:52.730
Oh, I wish that happened.
噢，真希望那是真的。

1464
00:58:52.850 --> 00:58:53.410
Me, too.
我也是。

1465
00:58:53.970 --> 00:58:56.370
Well, Holly can't go because she has a date tonight.
好吧，霍莉去不了，因为她今晚有约会。

1466
00:58:57.130 --> 00:58:57.310
Mm.
嗯。

1467
00:58:57.530 --> 00:58:59.810
And then Michael has the sweetest talking head.
然后迈克尔有一段特别暖心的采访。

1468
00:59:00.030 --> 00:59:01.530
He's like, Holly doesn't need any luck.
他说，霍莉不需要什么运气。

1469
00:59:01.870 --> 00:59:04.330
Everyone who meets her instantly loves her.
每个见到她的人都会立刻喜欢上她。

1470
00:59:05.170 --> 00:59:05.430
Yeah.
是啊。

1471
00:59:05.710 --> 00:59:06.450
So cute.
太可爱了。

1472
00:59:06.450 --> 00:59:08.310
I want these two kids to get together.
我真希望这两个人能在一起。

1473
00:59:08.930 --> 00:59:13.150
Angela, I have a question for you about the next scene, which is when Dwight busts in
安吉拉，关于下一场戏我有个问题，就是德怀特冲进来那场，

1474
00:59:13.150 --> 00:59:14.610
and he kicks over the cake.
他把蛋糕踢翻了。

1475
00:59:14.850 --> 00:59:15.030
Yeah.
对。

1476
00:59:15.410 --> 00:59:16.310
I wasn't there.
我当时不在场。

1477
00:59:16.470 --> 00:59:17.230
I'm at art school.
我在艺术学校。

1478
00:59:17.470 --> 00:59:18.850
What was it like to shoot that scene?
拍那场戏是什么感觉？

1479
00:59:19.010 --> 00:59:19.650
Here's the thing.
是这样的。

1480
00:59:20.010 --> 00:59:24.990
That room was like, I mean, Jenna, it was like six feet by six feet.
那个房间，我是说，珍娜，大概只有六英尺乘六英尺那么大。

1481
00:59:25.370 --> 00:59:26.810
It is really small.
确实非常小。

1482
00:59:26.810 --> 00:59:28.130
And we were all in there.
我们全都挤在里面。

1483
00:59:28.250 --> 00:59:32.870
They tried to put chairs in so that we could sit, but not everyone could sit, obviously.
他们试着放了些椅子让我们坐，但显然不是每个人都能坐下。

1484
00:59:33.050 --> 00:59:33.350
Mm-hmm.
嗯。

1485
00:59:33.610 --> 00:59:35.030
We were pretty crammed in.
我们挤得厉害。

1486
00:59:35.190 --> 00:59:37.350
I remember I couldn't look at Phyllis or I would laugh.
我记得我当时不能看菲利斯，不然我就会笑场。

1487
00:59:37.610 --> 00:59:38.090
Mm-hmm.
嗯。

1488
00:59:38.310 --> 00:59:41.950
Whenever she had her exchange with Michael, she would kind of, you know, start to break
每当她和迈克尔有对手戏时，她就会，你知道，有点儿

1489
00:59:41.950 --> 00:59:42.270
a little.
绷不住了。

1490
00:59:42.630 --> 00:59:47.310
And then Rain kicked over that cake with such, like, force.
然后雷恩踢那个蛋糕时，力气特别大。

1491
00:59:47.490 --> 00:59:47.670
Yeah.
是啊。

1492
00:59:47.750 --> 00:59:48.970
It went flying.
蛋糕直接飞出去了。

1493
00:59:49.370 --> 00:59:51.070
We all got cake on us.
我们身上都沾到了蛋糕。

1494
00:59:51.490 --> 00:59:52.990
And then they would have to clean it up.
然后他们就得清理现场。

1495
00:59:53.110 --> 00:59:56.250
We couldn't do it very many times because we were like, Rain, do you have to kick it
我们没法拍太多次，因为我们当时就在说，雷恩，你非得踢得

1496
00:59:56.250 --> 00:59:56.950
that hard?
那么用力吗？

1497
00:59:58.310 --> 01:00:02.290
So pretty much, I just remember being crammed in and trying not to laugh.
所以基本上，我只记得当时挤在里面，努力不让自己笑出来。

1498
01:00:02.590 --> 01:00:04.930
Well, I thought that scene looked like it was a lot of fun to shoot.
我觉得那场戏拍起来应该很有意思。

1499
01:00:04.930 --> 01:00:09.550
And I know, don't ask Rain Wilson to kick something unless you really want it kicked.
而且我知道，别让雷恩·威尔森去踢什么东西，除非你是真的想把它踢烂。

1500
01:00:09.730 --> 01:00:09.850
Yeah.
是啊。

1501
01:00:09.950 --> 01:00:11.350
Unless you want it to go flying.
除非你想让它飞出去。

1502
01:00:11.570 --> 01:00:11.730
Yeah.
是啊。

1503
01:00:11.730 --> 01:00:16.430
I don't think they anticipated that that much cake would travel because it was quite a cleanup.
我觉得他们没预料到会有那么多蛋糕飞出来，因为清理起来相当麻烦。

1504
01:00:16.690 --> 01:00:19.650
Well, now it is week five of the weight loss competition.
好了，现在是减肥比赛的第五周了。

1505
01:00:19.910 --> 01:00:21.990
The Scranton branch is not doing very well.
斯克兰顿分部的情况不太妙。

1506
01:00:22.610 --> 01:00:28.010
Holly tells us that corporate has now upped the prize to five vacation days.
霍莉告诉我们，总公司现在把奖品增加到了五天带薪假。

1507
01:00:28.530 --> 01:00:30.810
But things are breaking down between people.
但大家之间的关系正在恶化。

1508
01:00:30.970 --> 01:00:32.050
I mean, Kevin's in the kitchen.
我是说，凯文在厨房里。

1509
01:00:32.210 --> 01:00:34.090
He's making himself a peanut butter bagel.
他正在给自己做一个花生酱贝果。

1510
01:00:34.370 --> 01:00:36.850
Creed and Kelly are glaring at him.
克里德和凯莉正怒视着他。

1511
01:00:37.050 --> 01:00:42.290
Oh, there's a deleted scene where Meredith and Kelly and Holly are working on the dry
哦，有个删减片段是梅雷迪斯、凯莉和霍莉在白板上写字。

1512
01:00:42.290 --> 01:00:42.970
erase board.
白板。

1513
01:00:43.130 --> 01:00:43.350
Yeah.
是啊。

1514
01:00:43.970 --> 01:00:46.830
And Kelly goes, I'm doing a blood type diet.
然后凯莉说，我在做血型减肥法。

1515
01:00:47.030 --> 01:00:48.630
And Meredith goes, who gives a f***?
梅雷迪斯说，谁在乎啊？

1516
01:00:48.870 --> 01:00:50.790
And Kelly goes, what'd you say, whore?
凯莉说，你说什么，你这贱人？

1517
01:00:50.930 --> 01:00:52.010
And Holly goes, I got it.
然后霍莉说，我明白了。

1518
01:00:52.070 --> 01:00:52.190
Okay.
好吧。

1519
01:00:52.270 --> 01:00:52.950
Hey, hey, hey.
嘿，嘿，嘿。

1520
01:00:53.290 --> 01:00:54.390
Oh my gosh.
天哪。

1521
01:00:54.390 --> 01:00:56.430
I mean, things are getting really intense.
我是说，情况变得非常紧张。

1522
01:00:56.430 --> 01:01:01.630
They're so intense that Kelly says in a talking head that she swallowed a tapeworm last night
紧张到凯莉在采访中说，她昨晚吞下了一条克里德从墨西哥给她的绦虫。

1523
01:01:01.630 --> 01:01:03.530
that Creed gave her from Mexico.
那条虫子。

1524
01:01:03.910 --> 01:01:07.930
Kelly, why would you swallow a worm Creed gave you?
凯莉，你为什么要吞下克里德给你的虫子？

1525
01:01:08.190 --> 01:01:08.730
I know.
我知道。

1526
01:01:08.850 --> 01:01:10.270
Creed says it wasn't a tapeworm.
克里德说那不是绦虫。

1527
01:01:10.590 --> 01:01:13.430
Angela, I'll have you know, I looked it up.
安吉拉，我得让你知道，我查过了。

1528
01:01:13.590 --> 01:01:13.850
Yeah.
是啊。

1529
01:01:14.310 --> 01:01:17.350
The tapeworm diet is a real thing.
绦虫减肥法是真实存在的。

1530
01:01:17.690 --> 01:01:18.970
Oh God, really?
天哪，真的吗？

1531
01:01:19.330 --> 01:01:24.190
Well, it's obviously illegal in the United States and it's totally dangerous.
嗯，这在美国显然是违法的，而且非常危险。

1532
01:01:24.190 --> 01:01:25.650
Where are they doing it?
他们在哪里做这种事？

1533
01:01:25.650 --> 01:01:31.170
I don't know, but I guess you can buy pills that have a tapeworm egg inside of it.
我不知道，但我猜你可以买到里面含有绦虫卵的药丸。

1534
01:01:31.210 --> 01:01:32.270
Don't do this.
别这么做。

1535
01:01:32.470 --> 01:01:32.870
No.
不。

1536
01:01:33.130 --> 01:01:36.330
I read on Healthline that it doesn't even work.
我在健康热线上读到过，这根本没用。

1537
01:01:36.670 --> 01:01:42.310
Because yes, it feeds off your body's nutrients, but it feeds off the good stuff too, right?
因为没错，它确实会消耗你身体的营养，但它也会消耗掉好的营养，对吧？

1538
01:01:42.310 --> 01:01:44.050
It doesn't just eat your fat, everybody.
各位，它不只是吃掉你的脂肪。

1539
01:01:44.050 --> 01:01:45.110
It eats everything.
它什么都吃。

1540
01:01:45.290 --> 01:01:46.950
And you get really sick.
而且你会病得很重。

1541
01:01:46.950 --> 01:01:51.630
You can get diarrhea, abdominal pain, nausea, fever, weakness.
你会腹泻、腹痛、恶心、发烧、虚弱。

1542
01:01:51.930 --> 01:01:54.150
You can also get bacterial infections.
你还可能感染细菌。

1543
01:01:54.150 --> 01:01:56.470
You can get neurological issues.
你可能会出现神经系统问题。

1544
01:01:57.010 --> 01:01:59.430
Most of these pills are a scam.
大多数这种药丸都是骗局。

1545
01:01:59.830 --> 01:02:00.350
Okay.
好吧。

1546
01:02:00.450 --> 01:02:01.930
They do not really have a tapeworm.
它们里面并没有真正的绦虫。

1547
01:02:01.930 --> 01:02:10.530
But a woman in Iowa swallowed a real one and she got super sick and she had to confess to her doctor what she did.
但爱荷华州有个女人吞下了一条真的绦虫，她病得非常严重，不得不向医生坦白她做了什么。

1548
01:02:10.730 --> 01:02:13.170
He had to report it to the State Department.
医生不得不向州卫生部门报告。

1549
01:02:13.390 --> 01:02:14.770
It was a whole crazy thing.
那真是一团糟。

1550
01:02:15.050 --> 01:02:16.830
He didn't even know how to kill it.
他甚至不知道该怎么杀死它。

1551
01:02:16.990 --> 01:02:17.790
It was a whole thing.
那可真是件大事。

1552
01:02:18.190 --> 01:02:21.610
Guys, do not swallow a tapeworm on purpose.
各位，千万别故意吞下绦虫。

1553
01:02:21.610 --> 01:02:26.390
This are words I'm saying just in case anyone out there thought they should.
我之所以这么说，是以防有人觉得应该这么做。

1554
01:02:27.490 --> 01:02:30.450
You know, Jenna, I have a tapeworm story.
你知道吗，珍娜，我有个关于绦虫的故事。

1555
01:02:31.170 --> 01:02:33.990
But you know I'm going to save it for the finale.
但你知道的，我要把它留到大结局再说。

1556
01:02:34.410 --> 01:02:38.450
When we are done with the whole run of the office, you will remember.
等我们把《办公室》全剧回顾完，你就会想起来了。

1557
01:02:38.730 --> 01:02:40.390
I don't want to spoil it.
我不想剧透。

1558
01:02:40.490 --> 01:02:42.290
There is a scene in the finale.
在大结局里有个场景。

1559
01:02:42.570 --> 01:02:44.150
I don't want to spoil it.
我不想剧透。

1560
01:02:44.150 --> 01:02:48.210
But you'll remember, Jenna, Rain and I traded tapeworm stories.
但你会想起来的，珍娜，雷恩和我交换过绦虫的故事。

1561
01:02:48.490 --> 01:02:50.090
I'm saving it for the finale.
我把它留到大结局再说。

1562
01:02:50.570 --> 01:03:01.010
Guys, if you've ever had a reason to tune in to at least our finale episode of Office Ladies, you have it now.
各位，如果你们曾经有过什么理由去收听我们《办公室女士》的节目，那现在就是最好的理由。

1563
01:03:01.210 --> 01:03:06.950
There is a real life Angela Rain moment that happens behind the scenes of the finale.
在大结局的幕后，发生了一个真实的安吉拉和雷恩的时刻。

1564
01:03:07.390 --> 01:03:09.030
It involves a tapeworm.
和绦虫有关。

1565
01:03:09.270 --> 01:03:10.790
We'll get to it.
我们到时候会讲的。

1566
01:03:10.790 --> 01:03:13.910
Well, guys, that's Weight Loss Part 1.
好了，各位，这就是《减肥》第一部分。

1567
01:03:15.090 --> 01:03:21.750
We will be back next week with Weight Loss Part 2 when Jim has a big surprise for Pam.
下周我们将回来继续《减肥》第二部分，届时吉姆会给帕姆一个大大的惊喜。

1568
01:03:21.910 --> 01:03:23.290
We're going to tell you all about it.
我们会把一切都告诉你们。

1569
01:03:23.570 --> 01:03:26.750
Aw, jam fans, you don't want to miss it.
噢，“吉姆和帕姆”的粉丝们，你们可千万别错过。

1570
01:03:27.050 --> 01:03:27.770
See you then.
到时见。

1571
01:03:27.910 --> 01:03:28.290
See ya.
再见。

1572
01:03:31.830 --> 01:03:33.810
Thank you for listening to Office Ladies.
感谢收听《办公室女士》。

